#! Startup with module loading, which is where most of a short script's time goes.
#! The idiom is `get <Name> from <module>`; there is no `std` namespace, and
#! `import std json` is not valid on any of these releases.
get Loads from json
get Dumps from json
get Pretty from json
get ReadOr from fs
get Lines from strings
get Upper from strings
say "checks imported"
